      "Id": 1050108040,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 40,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『波塞冬，你的巫女和信徒呢？/n　也该把他们叫到这里来了吧？』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080340",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108041,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 41,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『别急别急。他们说既然要到至高神面前，/n　就一定要以最完美的装束出现，所以还得再花一点时间。』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080350",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108042,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 42,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『……已经够久了吧！快把信徒和巫女们叫来！/n　我等不及了！快点！快——点——！』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080360",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108043,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 43,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『好了好了，冷静点。哦，看来准备好了。/n　抱歉啊，宙斯。那么，大家进来吧。』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080370",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108044,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 44,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108045,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 45,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『啊啊，多么美丽！你的美貌，无论哪位女神、/n　宁芙，甚至妖精都无人能及！』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080380",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108046,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 46,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『我心爱的人……请留在我身边吧。』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080390",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108047,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 47,
      "SpeakerName": "地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『啊啊……好开心，Darling……没想到你还会对我说这种话……！/n　最近的你，总觉得有些冷淡……』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080400",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "601"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108048,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 48,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『嗯？Darling？？突然这么叫……呵呵，我喜欢大胆的女孩。/n　而且“最近的我”是指……我们明明是初次……哈！！！』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080410",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108049,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 49,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『（仔细一看，这孩子……和我当年爱上的年轻赫拉简直一模一样，/n　　而且这里好像确实有返老还童之泉……难道说——）』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080420",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108050,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 50,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『Honey……？』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080430",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108051,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 51,
      "SpeakerName": "地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『嗯～怎么啦？听我说哦～。大家明明宴会都开始了，/n　却让我先在里面待一会儿呢？』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080440",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "601"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108052,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 52,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『（果、果然是赫拉～～～～～！！/n　　糟、糟了……）』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080450",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108053,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 53,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『（想背着她偷腥的事，还有明明对方就是年轻时的赫拉，/n　　我却完全没认出来的事……不能说，怎么可能说得出口！！）』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080460",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108054,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 54,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『（要是被发现……死。）』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080470",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108055,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 55,
      "SpeakerName": "地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『不过，我已经原谅你啦！你又像这样重新向我告白。/n　原来这一切，都是为了这个惊喜做的安排吧！』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080480",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "601"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108056,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 56,
      "SpeakerName": "八惠",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『当、当然了，My Honey。/n　我只是想再向你求一次婚而已。你不喜欢吗？』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080490",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "104"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108057,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 57,
      "SpeakerName": "地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『怎么会！那么热烈的求爱……让我想起以前了。/n　呵呵，最——喜欢你了！Darling！』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080500",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "601"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108058,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 58,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『噗、呵呵呵……啊——哈哈哈哈！快看，赫尔墨斯。/n　宙斯那家伙脸都青了，只能任人摆布！』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080510",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108059,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 59,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『看起来夫妻恩爱，真是再好不过了！/n　对那家伙来说，也算一剂良药吧。』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080520",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108060,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 60,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "『噗、呵呵呵呵♪诸位神明都能尽兴，在下不胜荣幸。/n　宴会嘛，本就该不拘礼节。既有趣，又幸福才对！』",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080530",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108061,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 61,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "BgmFileName": "23",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108062,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 62,
      "SpeakerName": "评审L",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……每位演员都拥有与Dai Star之名相称的、/n卓越演技。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080540",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108063,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 63,
      "SpeakerName": "评审L",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "而且与刚获得这份辉煌称号的时候相比，/n如今又进一步打磨得更加精湛。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080550",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108064,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 64,
      "SpeakerName": "评审M",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不仅是演技，歌声同样只能用精彩来形容。/n尤其是新妻八惠小姐的歌声，强烈触动了听众的内心……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080560",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108065,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 65,
      "SpeakerName": "评审N",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不过即使考虑到这些，我还是想特别提到一位演员。/n那就是银河座的千寿历。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080570",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108066,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 66,
      "SpeakerName": "评审N",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "她整体完成度之高，实在令人刮目相看。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080580",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050108067,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050108,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 67,
      "SpeakerName": "评审L",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "原来如此……看来不只是我，/n各位似乎也抱有同样的看法。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501080590",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    }
  ]
}